# EOL/encoding policy (bugs reproduzidos no Windows em 2026-10-08: autocrlf quebrou sha256 de provenance; PS 5.1 sem BOM gerou ParserError)
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.safetensors binary
